INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-001','SmaTrendBaseline','SMA20/SMA50 cross, close > SMA200, stop -10%','2026-10-20T00:00:00Z','BTC/USDT 1h through 2026-10-20','frozen reference','Original result (1 trade) was a harness artifact. Re-tested 2026-11-02 under the corrected harness (exploration, BTC/ETH/BNB): rejected on all three, drawdown 44-50% at base, 74-88% at stress; lookahead and recursive pass.');
INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-002','DonchianBreakoutBaseline','Close > prior 20-candle high; exit below prior 10-candle low; stop -10%','2026-10-20T00:00:00Z','BTC/USDT 1h through 2026-10-20','rejected at exploration','Corrected harness, exploration on BTC/ETH/BNB: positive only at the optimistic cost, drawdown 60-98%. Do not select by return alone.');
INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-003','BollingerMeanReversionBaseline','Lower 20-band, RSI14 < 30, close > SMA200; exit at middle band; stop -10%','2026-10-20T00:00:00Z','BTC/USDT 1h through 2026-10-20','rejected at exploration','Not yet tested under the corrected harness. Trend-failure risk.');
INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-004','SlowTimeSeriesMomentum','Use closed 1h candles only; signals evaluated at bar close, order executed at next bar open. Long only, one position, whole balance. ENTRY: close > highest high of the prior 1440 bars (60 days, excluding current bar) AND close > SMA(4800 bars, 200 days) of close AND no open position. EXIT: close < lowest low of the prior 720 bars (30 days, excluding current bar), OR close below entry price by 15% (hard stop, checked on closed bars). After any exit, no re-entry until at least 168 bars (7 days) have passed. No other filters, no pyramiding, no take-profit.','2026-10-30T13:28:34.345485+00:00','BTC, ETH, BNB 1h through 2026-10-30; no result data viewed beyond the context file''s exploration summaries','invalid: implementation deviated from rule','Exploration ran on an implementation that used min_periods=1440 on the 4800-candle SMA (to satisfy a too-short smoke window) and without the 168-candle cooldown (backtest ran without --enable-protections). Both harness flaws are fixed. The rule itself is untested. Recorded results: research/experiments/H-004-exploration/ and the 20261030T133614Z-h-004-* manifests.');
INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-005','VolatilitySqueezeBreakout','Closed 1h candles only; signals evaluated at bar close, order executed at next bar open. Long only, one position, whole balance. Definitions (all use completed bars): R(t) = (highest high of the 168 bars ending at t - lowest low of the 168 bars ending at t) / close(t). Squeeze(t) is true if R(t) is <= the 20th percentile of R over the 2160 bars ending at t-1 (rolling quantile 0.20, excluding the current bar). ENTRY at close of bar t when ALL hold: (1) Squeeze was true on at least one of the previous 24 bars (t-24..t-1); (2) close(t) > highest high of the prior 168 bars (t-168..t-1, excluding current bar); (3) close(t) > SMA(2400) of close; (4) no open position; (5) cooldown satisfied. EXIT at close of bar t when close(t) < lowest low of the prior 336 bars (t-336..t-1, excluding current), or via the hard stop. STOP-LOSS: fixed 8% below entry price (native intrabar stop). COOLDOWN: no re-entry for 72 candles after any exit. No take-profit, no pyramiding, no other filters. Warm-up: 2400 bars.','2026-10-30T13:49:38.324198+00:00','No price data viewed; only the context file and validation protocol (BTC, ETH, BNB 1h description through 2026-10-30).','rejected at exploration','Long breakout after a multi-day volatility squeeze in an established uptrend');
INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-006','RegimeGatedPullbackTrend','Closed 1h candles only; signals evaluated at bar close, order executed at next bar open. Long only, one position, whole balance. REGIME at bar t (all must hold): (a) close(t) > SMA(4800) of close; (b) SMA(2400)(t) > SMA(4800)(t); (c) SMA(4800)(t) > SMA(4800)(t-720). ENTRY at close of bar t when REGIME holds AND min(close over bars t-48..t-1) <= 0.95 * max(high over bars t-336..t-1) (a pullback of at least 5% from the 14-day high occurred within the last 48 bars) AND close(t) > SMA(48) of close AND close(t-1) <= SMA(48) at t-1 (fresh recovery cross above the 2-day mean) AND no open position AND cooldown satisfied. EXIT at close of bar t (executed next open) when any of: close(t) >= max(high over bars t-336..t-1) (prior 14-day high retested); close(t) < SMA(4800)(t) (regime lost); 240 bars have elapsed since entry (time stop). STOP-LOSS: fixed 5% below entry price (native intrabar stop). COOLDOWN: no re-entry for 48 candles after any exit. No pyramiding, no other filters. Warm-up: 5520 bars.','2026-10-30T17:42:27.332302+00:00','BTC, ETH, BNB 1h through 2026-10-20; exploration results listed in the context file only','failed','Bull-regime-only pullback re-entry with long-term slope gate and tight fixed stop');
INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-007','RisingTrendBreakoutGate','Closed 1h candles only; signals evaluated at bar close, order executed at next bar open. Long only, one position, whole balance. REGIME at bar t (all must hold): (a) SMA(1200)(t) > SMA(2400)(t); (b) SMA(2400)(t) > SMA(2400)(t-480) (long mean rising over the last 20 days); (c) close(t) > SMA(1200)(t). ENTRY at close of bar t when REGIME holds AND close(t) > highest high of the prior 480 bars (t-480..t-1, excluding current bar) AND no open position AND cooldown satisfied. EXIT at close of bar t (executed next open) when close(t) < lowest low of the prior 240 bars (t-240..t-1, excluding current bar) OR close(t) < SMA(1200)(t) (regime lost). STOP-LOSS: fixed 6% below entry price (native intrabar stop). COOLDOWN: no re-entry for 120 candles after any exit. No take-profit, no pyramiding, no other filters. Warm-up: 2880 bars (SMA(2400) plus 480-bar slope lag); startup_candle_count should be set to 2880 or a bit more (at most 4500) so recursive analysis is stable.','2026-10-30T18:29:04.404068+00:00','BTC, ETH, BNB 1h exploration-period summary results listed in the context file only, through 2026-10-30; no validation results seen','rejected at exploration','20-day breakout only inside a confirmed, rising multi-month uptrend, with 10-day channel exit');
INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-008','VolatilitySqueezeBreakout','Closed 1h candles only; signals evaluated at bar close, order executed at next bar open. Long only, one position, whole balance. Definitions (all use completed bars): R(t) = (highest high of the 168 bars ending at t - lowest low of the 168 bars ending at t) / close(t). Squeeze(t) is true if R(t) is <= the 20th percentile of R over the 2160 bars ending at t-1 (rolling quantile 0.20, excluding the current bar). ENTRY at close of bar t when ALL hold: (1) Squeeze was true on at least one of the previous 24 bars (t-24..t-1); (2) close(t) > highest high of the prior 168 bars (t-168..t-1, excluding current bar); (3) close(t) > SMA(2400) of close; (4) no open position; (5) cooldown satisfied. EXIT at close of bar t when close(t) < lowest low of the prior 336 bars (t-336..t-1, excluding current), or via the hard stop. STOP-LOSS: fixed 8% below entry price (native intrabar stop). COOLDOWN: no re-entry for 72 candles after any exit. No take-profit, no pyramiding, no other filters. Warm-up: 2400 bars. EXPOSURE (the only change from H-005): each trade uses 20% of the account (tradable_balance_ratio 0.20), the rest stays in cash. Rule for the number: the largest exposure on a 5% grid for which the seeded block-bootstrap (lab/bootstrap.py, block 3, 4000 resamples, seed 1) 95th-percentile closed-trade max drawdown of the H-005 exploration trades is <= 25% on BTC, ETH and BNB at once; that gives 20% (p95 20%/22%/24%; 25% gives 24%/27%/29%). Only exploration trades were used; the validation split and the final test were not read.','2026-11-02T23:39:49.008873+00:00','H-005 exploration trade lists and metrics (BTC, ETH, BNB) through 2026-10-30; no validation or final-test results seen.','not approved at validation','Exploration: candidate on BTC/ETH/BNB (drawdown 12-14%). Validation (read once, 2024-07..2026-10): profit positive on all three (+6.3/+6.9/+10.3 on 100) with drawdown 2.4-7.7%, but only 12/10/8 trades (gate needs 30, so inconclusive) and profit without the best trade negative on BTC and BNB. Not a candidate.');
INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-009','WeeklyBreakoutRegime','Closed 1h candles only; signals evaluated at bar close, order executed at next bar open. Long only, one position, whole allowed balance. REGIME at bar t: SMA(720)(t) > SMA(2160)(t) AND close(t) > SMA(720)(t). ENTRY at close of bar t when REGIME holds AND close(t) > highest high of the prior 168 bars (t-168..t-1, excluding current bar) AND no open position AND cooldown satisfied. EXIT at close of bar t (executed next open) when close(t) < lowest low of the prior 72 bars (excluding current bar) OR close(t) < SMA(720)(t). STOP-LOSS: fixed 6% below entry (native intrabar stop). COOLDOWN: 24 candles after any exit. No take-profit, no pyramiding, no other filters. Warm-up: 2160 bars. EXPOSURE: each trade uses a fixed share of the account (tradable_balance_ratio), the rest stays in cash. The share is the largest value on a 5% grid for which the seeded block-bootstrap (lab/bootstrap.py choose_exposure: block 3, 4000 resamples, seed 1) 95th-percentile closed-trade max drawdown is <= 25% on BTC, ETH and BNB at once, computed from this rule''s own exploration trades at base cost with full exposure (a calibration run, exploration split only). The value is recorded in the notes after calibration; the rule for choosing it is fixed now. If the calibration run shows fewer than 30 trades on any pair the hypothesis is dropped, not retuned. Validation split and final test not read.','2026-11-02T23:59:40.709384+00:00','Context summaries plus H-005/H-007/H-008 results and general literature (tradingstrategy.ai learn pages: Donchian/trend and moving-average timing); no result of this rule seen.','candidate at exploration','7-day breakout in a 30d/90d uptrend: more trades per year than H-007 (20-day breakout), regime gate shortened to match. Textbook horizons, no tuning. Calibrated exposure: 0.25 (p95 by pair {''BTC/USDT'': 0.11619927151132928, ''ETH/USDT'': 0.2167829050039351, ''BNB/USDT'': 0.23302999449418582}). Calibration trades: {''BTC/USDT'': 58, ''ETH/USDT'': 81, ''BNB/USDT'': 80}.');
INSERT INTO "hypotheses" VALUES('H-010','UptrendPullbackRecovery','Closed 1h candles only; signals evaluated at bar close, order executed at next bar open. Long only, one position, whole allowed balance. REGIME at bar t: close(t) > SMA(2400)(t) AND SMA(720)(t) > SMA(2400)(t). ENTRY at close of bar t when REGIME holds AND min(close over bars t-48..t-1) <= 0.95 * max(high over bars t-336..t-1) (a pullback of at least 5% from the 14-day high within the last 48 bars) AND close(t) > SMA(48)(t) AND close(t-1) <= SMA(48)(t-1) (fresh recovery cross) AND no open position AND cooldown satisfied. EXIT at close of bar t (executed next open) when close(t) >= max(high over bars t-336..t-1) OR close(t) < SMA(2400)(t). STOP-LOSS: fixed 5% below entry (native intrabar stop). COOLDOWN: 48 candles after any exit. No time stop, no pyramiding, no other filters. Warm-up: 2400 bars. EXPOSURE: each trade uses a fixed share of the account (tradable_balance_ratio), the rest stays in cash. The share is the largest value on a 5% grid for which the seeded block-bootstrap (lab/bootstrap.py choose_exposure: block 3, 4000 resamples, seed 1) 95th-percentile closed-trade max drawdown is <= 25% on BTC, ETH and BNB at once, computed from this rule''s own exploration trades at base cost with full exposure (a calibration run, exploration split only). The value is recorded in the notes after calibration; the rule for choosing it is fixed now. If the calibration run shows fewer than 30 trades on any pair the hypothesis is dropped, not retuned. Validation split and final test not read.','2026-11-02T23:59:40.709384+00:00','Context summaries plus H-005/H-007/H-008 results and general literature (tradingstrategy.ai learn pages: Donchian/trend and moving-average timing); no result of this rule seen.','rejected at exploration','H-006 idea (never ran: 5520-bar warm-up) with a 2400-bar long mean so it fits the 4500 limit; no time stop. Untested before. Calibrated exposure: 0.10 (p95 by pair {''BTC/USDT'': 0.17472074793385642, ''ETH/USDT'': 0.24208648328033058, ''BNB/USDT'': 0.20134252321239815}). Calibration trades: {''BTC/USDT'': 145, ''ETH/USDT'': 187, ''BNB/USDT'': 173}.');
